    featuredImagePrompt: "An intricate, data-driven infographic-style visual representing the global impact of GTA 6. The central element is a stylized, glowing 'GTA VI' logo. Surrounding it are interconnected nodes and lines depicting digital information flow, fan engagement metrics, and market capitalization graphs subtly integrated into the background. Elements like abstract outlines of gaming console controllers and subtle national flag colors (India, US, UK, Canada, Australia) could be woven into the data streams. The overall composition should convey both immense excitement and the serious undercurrent of data security and legal proceedings. Use a vibrant, tech-inspired color palette with shades of blue, purple, and green against a dark, futuristic backdrop.",
