    featuredImagePrompt: "Conceptual visual depicting a vibrant, glowing blockchain network forming a clear, illuminated pathway leading directly towards a stylized, modern legislative building. The pathway symbolizes regulatory clarity and progress. In the background, subtle, abstract outlines of global continents (India, North America, Europe, Australia) are faintly visible, suggesting worldwide impact. The color palette should incorporate cool blues and digital greens for technology and clarity, with hints of warm gold emanating from the pathway and legislative structure, representing value and importance. Avoid any specific national flags or overly literal depictions of specific politicians. The overall composition should be dynamic and forward-looking, emphasizing a blend of innovation and governance.",
