      bearCase: "The bearish case centers on persistent high inflation necessitating continued aggressive monetary tightening by global central banks, particularly the US Federal Reserve. This would maintain a \'risk-off\' environment, suppressing appetite for speculative assets like cryptocurrencies. Further escalation of geopolitical conflicts could exacerbate economic instability and fuel commodity prices, further dampening investor sentiment. Regulatory crackdowns or adverse policy decisions in major markets could also trigger significant downside.",
