      regulatoryDevelopments: "The most significant recent regulatory development was the SEC\'s approval of spot Bitcoin ETFs in the U.S. Globally, regulators are still grappling with how to classify and regulate cryptocurrencies, with ongoing discussions around stablecoins, DeFi, and national digital currencies. The regulatory landscape remains a key risk factor.",
