      bearCase: "The unprecedented scale of the hack and the involvement of a sophisticated state-sponsored actor could severely erode overall investor confidence in centralized crypto exchanges. This might trigger a significant shift towards self-custody or decentralized finance (DeFi) platforms, reducing trading volumes and liquidity on CEXs. Increased regulatory backlash could also stifle innovation and growth.",
      neutralCase: "While a major incident, Binance\'s response and the FBI\'s attribution provide clarity. The market may absorb the shock, but ongoing security concerns will persist. The incident could catalyze industry-wide security improvements and regulatory clarity, leading to a more mature, albeit more regulated, crypto market in the long run.",
      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A \'Cautiously Bearish\' outlook (40% Bearish, 35% Neutral, 25% Bullish). The immediate financial impact on users is mitigated by Binance\'s pledge, but the reputational damage and the precedent of state-sponsored attacks of this magnitude will likely weigh heavily on investor sentiment and regulatory action. While Binance may recover, the broader market will face increased scrutiny and skepticism.",
